    "name":  "LED Bulb RGB + 3000K - 10W 270º E27 with Remote Control",
    "reference":  "A6010W-RGB-92035",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLED Bulb 10W RGB + 3000K E27\u003c/strong\u003e. This versatile bulb combines RGB colors with \u003cstrong\u003ewarm white light\u003c/strong\u003e to offer customized lighting to your taste. Includes a \u003cstrong\u003eremote control\u003c/strong\u003e for easy and convenient control, allowing you to adjust the atmosphere of any room according to your needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerfect for decorating and creating indoor atmospheres, this 10W bulb allows you to create the ideal atmosphere with style and efficiency. Add a touch of color and warmth to your home today!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eRGB + 3000K LED Bulb - 10W 270º E27 with Remote Control\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e10W RGB + 3000K E27 LED Bulb\u003c/strong\u003e combines RGB color customization with warm white 3000K functional lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1. Customizable Lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e Choose from 16 million RGB colors plus warm 3000K white.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2. Remote Control:\u003c/strong\u003e Adjust color, intensity, and modes wirelessly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3. Energy Efficient:\u003c/strong\u003e 10W LED, long lifespan.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4. Decoration Versatility:\u003c/strong\u003e Standard E27 fitting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e5. Advanced Lighting Modes:\u003c/strong\u003e Smooth transitions, rhythmic flashing, fixed light modes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eRecommended Applications:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModern Homes\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCreative Offices\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCommercial Spaces and Boutiques\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpecial Events\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e",
